scenario a receiver that stops saying does not thereby say fine
describe OWNER_DECISIONS OD-5. On the LS550G anti-spoofing is UNKNOWN, not
describe SUPPORTED, and this trace is what that distinction costs in behaviour:
describe silence and incapability both leave the alarm standing, and only a
describe positive all-clear takes it down.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof critical
  expect trust untrusted
  expect reason receiver-spoofing

# The receiver says nothing about spoofing at all.
at 2000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000005 10000005
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof unknown
  expect trust untrusted
  expect reason receiver-spoofing

# A receiver that has no such feature. Not the same as a clean bill of health.
at 4000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000010 10000010
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof unsupported
  expect trust untrusted
  expect reason receiver-spoofing

# And now a positive all-clear, which is information rather than silence.
at 6000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000015 10000015
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  jam none
  spoof none
  expect no-reason receiver-spoofing
  expect trust untrusted            # cleared, but recovery is still held
